    "text": "By Connor DeWine, Staff Writer ,\n10 hours ago SCIOTO COUNTY, Ohio — Crews will pave two township roads and resurface two others in Scioto County during the week of Sept. 21 through Sept. 24, weather permitting, according to the county engineer’s office. Darren C. LeBrun, P.E., P.S., the Scioto County Engineer, announced the schedule this week... Read full article",
